  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Migration Information Centre (MIC) &#x201c;I Choose Lithuania&#x201d; 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at facilitating the return and (re-) integration of Lithuanian diaspora and their family members - foreigners, arriving in Lithuania through the provision of information and counseling at the IOM Migration Information Centre (MIC). It responds to the current migration context in Lithuania, where emigration rates are still among the highest in Europe, while immigration to Lithuania in the last 5 years increased more than twice. Surveys show that a significant number of Lithuanians envisage returning home.</narrative>
  </description>
